      {'id':'C02','priority':'P2','scope':'phase identity and resource validity','finding':'Storage expiry is validated only at admission entry; its expiry can precede the phase admission expiry. Source accepts equal inspection/numerical job IDs, and admission expiry is checked only between cells. No in-cell watchdog exists.','evidence':'runner lines123,155-164,490-513; root_boundary_characterization.json two accepted mock cases','action':'Use distinct phase job IDs and separate new reservations/launchers. Make storage validity cover the planned phase and externally stop on expiry/resource exhaustion.','status':'nonblocking for source/handmade verdict; root enforcement required'},
      {'id':'C03','priority':'P2','scope':'resource/performance claims','finding':'One Torch thread and output caps are enforced, but total CPU RAM, transient decoder/autograd/optimizer memory and execution time are unmeasured. Eight runtime pins do not hash every transitive package/library file.','evidence':'runner lines143-148,463-467 and numerical loop; declared eight runtime paths; installed_runtime_file_sha256.json','action':'Root must admit execution duration, installed environment and memory/storage headroom before actual32. Preserve the source-estimate exclusions; do not claim measured speed or memory.','status':'unrun operational gate'},
